idea="An idea, good or bad, quickly noted down."
needsPlan="An idea, clearly understandable but too complex to be fully specified in-place. Tasks with this status require an extra planning step before they can be considered \"planned\"."
planned="Has either a more elaborated prompt than just an idea OR a standalone plan file, but either way it's still under construction."
approved="The plan is approved and ready for breakdown into subtasks."
ready="Ready for implementation."
inProgress="Vibe is working on implementing this task."
interrupted="Vibe has worked on this but was interrupted or exited before completion."
onHold="Don't pick up this task for the time being."
review="Implementation is complete, now this task wants human review."
done="Implementation complete and approved by a human."